<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8022" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cĭnaedus</span></b> ,
		i, m., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κίναιδος</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>He who practises unnatural lust</i>, <i>a sodomite</i>, <i>catamite</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Plaut. As. 3, 3, 37</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Aul. 3,
				2, 8</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Poen. 5, 5, 40</span></i>; Scip. Afric.
			ap. <i><span class="en">Gell.
				7, 12, 5</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Cat. 16, 2</span></i>; <i><span class="en">25, 1</span></i>;
					<i><span class="en">Petr. 21, 2</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Juv. 2,
			10</span></i>; <i><span class="en">14, 30
			al.</span></i>—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>Adj.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cĭnaedus</span></b> , a, um, <i>wanton</i>, <i>unchaste</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ut decuit cinaediorem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cat.
					10, 24</span></i>
			.—<b>Trop.</b>, <i>impudent</i>, <i>shameless</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">homo cinaedā fronte,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart. 6, 39, 12</span></i>
			.— Hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>He who performs a wanton dance</i>, <i><span class="en">Plaut. Mil.
				3, 1, 73</span></i>; Lucil. ap. <i><span class="en">Non. p. 5,
			31</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>III.</b>
			<i>The name of a sea-fish</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 33,
				11, 53, § 146</span></i>.</div>
